		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="55254"></a><b>Wzywig</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Emperor Ssraeshza<br /><br /><br />Joined: 23 Sep 2003<br />Posts: 305<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=55254&amp;sid=318791026c8fa1cdb4d3964383cbf8f0#55254"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Mar 17, 2005 8:59 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: BEFORE APPLYING PLEASE READ THE FOLLOWING !!</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=55254&amp;sid=318791026c8fa1cdb4d3964383cbf8f0"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">For those of you applying. The most important thing YOU yourself as an app can show is that you level to the approximation of the requirements first. NOT only that... but if you cannot dedicate yourself to raiding ***3 - times a week MINIMUM ***(that means full from the raid beginning to end) around 6,30 pm to around 10 - 11pm gmt (maybe more)... Then I don't think we need you. (maybe if you were a certain class, yes, but I still need ACTIVE members... *NOT* casual players) 
<br />

<br />
Dawnraiders is a raiding guild. We need active people like YOU out there, And I know you want to be part of the best. This is your chance. We are ACTIVELY recruiting people who are.... 
<br />

<br />
1. Skilled 
<br />
2. <a href="http://www.dawnraiders.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=5602" target="_blank" class="postlink">Meet Requirements</a>
<br />
3. Of key classes 
<br />
4. Active (as previously mentioned) 
<br />
5. Meet flag requirements AND MUST HAVE ALL EXPANSIONS. 
<br />

<br />
Equipment needs to be around elemental and time level. And 36 - 41% haste for melee and around that equivalent for Priest/caster classes. No Epic? No problem. We might help you a bit, but don't expect it. There are VERY successful people in Dawnraders without epics, but that doesn't hinder how they can play their character to their full potential.  If you're joining Dawnraiders to be equipped, I don't need you either. We're here to get further in the game, and loot is only a secondary. (It will come naturally of course, if the guild performs well.) 
<br />

<br />
Applicants are to post on the message board, and write an introduction to yourself (level, AA, Flags, Previous guild history), A small essay regarding your class and it's role in a raid situation, and the top 3 reasons a raid fails.
<br />
If you are thinking about joining Dawnraiders and just happened to read this on a pass-by but think you're not good enough or Dawnraiders is too l337 for you? Well you are wrong. As long as you have activity and the will to learn, you will always improve your game. Don't settle for apping for other guilds just because "you don't think you have what it takes" Apply for yourself then figure out if it's right for you or not! I know there are many Dawnraiders who talk to me and tell me, "I didn't apply before because I thought I wasn't good enough." Most of those people fit right in and enjoy the high-end raiding guild on venril sathir 
<br />

<br />
If you have read this, and like what you see please look at our recruitment page, and see if we have a spot open for you. 
<br />

<br />
Good luck to you guys on your applications</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
